#
# Optional topic SHA pinning config.
#
# Use this with ci-merge --sha-config/-s when a topic should be merged at a
# fixed commit instead of the current tip of the branch listed in ci.conf.
#
# Format:
# <topic remote name> <commit sha>
#
# The topic remote name must match the first column in the main ci.conf file.
# Topics not listed here continue to merge the configured branch tip.
#
# Example:
#john.doe 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567
